WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.210
Ellie wants the council to mend
the broken swings in her local

2
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:04.250
park.

3
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.390
She writes her message fast.

4
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.170
"Oi, sort the swings
out, they're rubbish!

5
00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:10.790
" Her point is fair.

6
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.850
The swings really are broken.

7
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.730
So why might her message get nowhere?

8
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:19.590
And what should she ask herself
before writing a single word?

9
00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.920
In this mission, you'll find the
purpose of a piece of writing.

10
00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:25.130
You'll think about who is reading it.

11
00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:27.270
You'll pick the right
form for the job.

12
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:31.430
And you'll plan, draft,
edit and proofread.

13
00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:34.970
Your mission: help Ellie rewrite
her message so the council

14
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.270
listens.
